#. ja: 極密型トームストーン
#. de: hermetisch[a] Allagisch[a] Stein
#. fr: mémoquartz ultradense
#. column 2: hermetic tomestones
#. column 8: While it is a surpassingly small means of storing knowledge, the information deposited on this relic of Allagan society was compressed with heretofore unseen efficiency. Such a wealth of knowledge would not come without a sacrifice to portability, however, and this tomestone is unfathomably heavy as a result. This particular variety is not as highly sought as it once was, and may no longer be exchanged for other wares.
#. column 9: Hermetic Tomestone
msgctxt "Item:40321:0:0"
msgid "hermetic tomestone"
msgstr "герметичный том-камень"

