#. de: magisch[a] Kinderbett
#. fr: lit enfant magique
#. column 2: magicked children's beds
#. column 8: For as long as beds have existed, children have dreamed of having one that flies. Thanks to this winsome piece lovingly crafted for younglings─and the young at heart─that dream is now a reality.
