#. column 2: mermaid scales
#. column 8: These rainbow-colored mollusks are believed to come from mermaids. Alas, not a one has ever been sighted, suggesting they have no desire to explore up where we walk, up where we run, up where we stay all day in the sun.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Mermaid Scale
msgctxt "Item:40531:0:0"
