#. ja: オクトパスインポスター
#. de: Tarnoktopus
#. fr: poulpe imposteur
#. column 2: impostopodes
#. column 8: This doppelganger of the deep is able to mimic prey using its tentacles as it approaches. The psychological trauma of being attacked by oneself─or perhaps a loved one that relatives would jokingly call one's twin─often paralyzes the victim as the impostopus feeds.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
