msgstr "Мистухики"

#. ja: コバンウツボ
#. de: Riechermuräne
#. fr: murène koban
#. column 2: snapping koban
#. column 8: This wavekin's golden fins and mouth appear as coins floating in the ocean, giving the impression that sailors of the Kugane coast are quite cavalier with their finances.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
#. column 9: Snapping Koban
msgctxt "Item:40551:0:0"
msgid "snapping koban"
msgstr "щелкающий кобан"

