#. ja: イダテントビウオ
#. de: fliegend[a] Gottesfisch
#. fr: poisson volant d'Idaten
#. column 2: Idaten's bolts
#. column 8: Said to be blessed by the gods with blinding speed, sometimes these fish tire of water and propel themselves into the sky on the back of a spectral current.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
#. column 9: Idaten's Bolt
msgctxt "Item:40556:0:0"
msgid "Idaten's bolt"
msgstr "рывок Идатэна"

