msgid "Idaten's Bolt"
msgstr "Рывок Идатэна"

#. ja: タツマキサザエ
#. de: Tornadoschnecke
#. fr: turbo tatsumaki
#. column 2: maelstrom turbans
#. column 8: The presence of these shellfish in shallow waters is considered to be an ill omen, for they are believed to be the harbinger of storms, violent winds, and worse.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Maelstrom Turban
msgctxt "Item:40557:0:0"
msgid "maelstrom turban"
msgstr "водоворотная улитка"

