msgstr "Водоворотная улитка"

#. ja: ショウシツキ
#. de: Teufelshai
#. fr: shôshitsuki
#. column 2: shoshitsuki
#. column 8: The fleetness of these sharks is enough to tire even a god, but where divinity sees a menace, a fisher sees opportunity.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
