#. column 8: Now that its spectral nature has taken precedence, the question of whether this wavekin is a snake or an eel has become irrelevant.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
msgctxt "Item:40569:0:9"
msgid "Spectral Snake Eel"
msgstr "Призрачный змеёугорь"

#. ja: アメノトラ
#. de: Himmelstiger
#. fr: requin-tigre céleste
#. column 2: heavensent sharks
#. column 8: This shark is believed to be the reincarnation of a tiger descended from Heaven-on-High.<br><br>[Suitable for display in aquariums tier 2 and higher.]<br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
#. column 9: Heavensent Shark
msgctxt "Item:40570:0:0"
msgid "heavensent shark"
msgstr "небесная акула"

#. de: Himmelstiger
#. fr: requins-tigres célestes
#. column 0: heavensent shark
#. column 8: This shark is believed to be the reincarnation of a tiger descended from Heaven-on-High.<br><br>[Suitable for display in aquariums tier 2 and higher.]<br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
#. column 9: Heavensent Shark
msgctxt "Item:40570:0:2"
msgid "heavensent sharks"
msgstr "небесные акулы"

#. ja: アメノミハシラから舞い降りた虎が転じたとされるサメの一種<br>紅玉海沖合の稀少魚<br>[G2以上の水槽で飼育可能]<br>[魚拓額縁G2に設定可能]
#. de: Die Legende besagt, dass einst ein Tiger von der Himmelssäule herabstieg und sich in diese Haiart verwandelte. Seltener Fisch der Rubinsee. (Kann in Aquarien der Größe M oder größer gehalten werden. Kann als Fischdruck in Rahmen der Größe M ausgestellt werden.)
#. fr: Un tigre tombé du Pilier des Cieux serait devenu ce farouche requin.<br>Rarissime, on l'aperçoit parfois dans la Mer de Rubis.<br>[Peut être élevé dans un aquarium de taille moyenne ou supérieure]<br>[Affichable dans un cadre à ichtyogramme de taille moyenne]
#. column 0: heavensent shark
#. column 2: heavensent sharks
#. column 9: Heavensent Shark
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:40570:0:8"
msgid "This shark is believed to be the reincarnation of a tiger descended from Heaven-on-High.<br><br>[Suitable for display in aquariums tier 2 and higher.]<br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]"
msgstr "Считается, что эта акула — переродившийся тигр, спустившийся с Высоких небес.<br><br>[Можно держать в аквариуме II уровня или выше.]<br>[Можно выставить в рамке для рыбного отпечатка среднего размера.]"

