msgctxt "Item:40570:0:9"
msgid "Heavensent Shark"
msgstr "Небесная акула"

#. ja: バショウイカ
#. de: Segelkalmar
#. fr: calmar fugace
#. column 2: fleeting squid
#. column 8: When winter descends upon Kugane and its vibrant flora wilts, some look to the sea, where the skin of this cephalopod reminds them of warmer seasons.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
#. column 9: Fleeting Squid
msgctxt "Item:40571:0:0"
msgid "fleeting squid"
msgstr "мимолётный кальмар"

#. de: Segelkalmare
#. fr: calmars fugaces
#. column 0: fleeting squid
#. column 8: When winter descends upon Kugane and its vibrant flora wilts, some look to the sea, where the skin of this cephalopod reminds them of warmer seasons.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
#. column 9: Fleeting Squid
msgctxt "Item:40571:0:2"
msgid "fleeting squid"
msgstr "мимолётные кальмары"

#. ja: 芭蕉の葉に似た魚体を持つ優美なイカ<br>紅玉海沖合の稀少魚<br>[魚拓額縁G2に設定可能]
#. de: Die Form dieses anmutigen Tintenfisches erinnert stark an die segelartigen Blätter der Bananenstaude. Seltener Fisch der Rubinsee. (Kann als Fischdruck in Rahmen der Größe M ausgestellt werden.)
#. fr: Un calmar au corps fin et élancé, ressemblant à une feuille.<br>[Affichable dans un cadre à ichtyogramme de taille moyenne]
#. column 0: fleeting squid
#. column 2: fleeting squid
#. column 9: Fleeting Squid
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:40571:0:8"
msgid "When winter descends upon Kugane and its vibrant flora wilts, some look to the sea, where the skin of this cephalopod reminds them of warmer seasons.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]"
msgstr "Когда зима приходит в Куганэ и яркая зелень увядает, некоторые обращают взор к морю: окраска этого головоногого напоминает о тёплых днях.<br><br>[Можно выставить в рамке для рыбного отпечатка среднего размера.]"

