msgctxt "Item:40571:0:9"
msgid "Fleeting Squid"
msgstr "Мимолётный кальмар"

#. ja: 弓馬海老
#. de: bogenbärtig[a] Pferdegarnele
#. fr: langouste archère
#. column 2: bowbarb lobsters
#. column 8: The long whiskers of this massive lobster curve like a bow, and some Kugane children cannot resist playing at imaginary war around the dinner table.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Bowbarb Lobster
msgctxt "Item:40572:0:0"
msgid "bowbarb lobster"
msgstr "омар-лучник"

#. de: bogenbärtig[a] Pferdegarnelen
#. fr: langoustes archères
#. column 0: bowbarb lobster
#. column 8: The long whiskers of this massive lobster curve like a bow, and some Kugane children cannot resist playing at imaginary war around the dinner table.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Bowbarb Lobster
msgctxt "Item:40572:0:2"
msgid "bowbarb lobsters"
msgstr "омары-лучники"

#. ja: 長いヒゲが弓のようだとされる大型の馬海老<br>紅玉海沖合の稀少魚<br>[魚拓額縁G1に設定可能]
#. de: Ein größerer Verwandter der Pferdegarnele, dessen langer Bart häufig mit einem Bogen verglichen wird. Seltener Fisch der Rubinsee. (Kann als Fischdruck in Rahmen der Größe S ausgestellt werden.)
#. fr: Une langouste aux longues antennes recourbées tel un arc. Rarissime, on l'aperçoit parfois dans la Mer de Rubis.<br>[Affichable dans un cadre à ichtyogramme de petite taille]
#. column 0: bowbarb lobster
#. column 2: bowbarb lobsters
#. column 9: Bowbarb Lobster
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:40572:0:8"
msgid "The long whiskers of this massive lobster curve like a bow, and some Kugane children cannot resist playing at imaginary war around the dinner table.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]"
msgstr "Длинные усы этого громадного омара изогнуты, словно лук. Детям Куганэ так и хочется разыграть за обеденным столом воображаемую битву.<br><br>[Можно выставить в рамке для рыбного отпечатка малого размера.]"

#. ja: 弓馬海老
