msgctxt "Item:40572:0:9"
msgid "Bowbarb Lobster"
msgstr "Омар-лучник"

#. ja: オハグロナマコ
#. de: Dunkelzahn-Seegurke
#. fr: holothurie rayée
#. column 2: pitch pickles
#. column 8: Biting into the flesh of this wavekin will stain one's entire mouth black, which is useful if you have occasion to disguise yourself as ancient Far Eastern nobility.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Pitch Pickle
msgctxt "Item:40573:0:0"
msgid "pitch pickle"
msgstr "смоляной огурец"

#. de: Dunkelzahn-Seegurken
#. fr: holothuries rayées
#. column 0: pitch pickle
#. column 8: Biting into the flesh of this wavekin will stain one's entire mouth black, which is useful if you have occasion to disguise yourself as ancient Far Eastern nobility.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Pitch Pickle
msgctxt "Item:40573:0:2"
msgid "pitch pickles"
msgstr "смоляные огурцы"

#. ja: 齧ると歯が真っ黒に染まるという黒い棘皮動物<br>紅玉海沖合の稀少魚<br>[魚拓額縁G1に設定可能]
#. de: Ein schwarz gefärbter Stachelhäuter, von dem einem die Zähne sogar schwarz anlaufen, wenn man hineinbeißt. Seltener Fisch der Rubinsee. (Kann als Fischdruck in Rahmen der Größe S ausgestellt werden.)
#. fr: Une variété de concombre de mer servant de pigment pour se noircir les dents.<br>[Affichable dans un cadre à ichtyogramme de petite taille]
#. column 0: pitch pickle
#. column 2: pitch pickles
#. column 9: Pitch Pickle
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:40573:0:8"
msgid "Biting into the flesh of this wavekin will stain one's entire mouth black, which is useful if you have occasion to disguise yourself as ancient Far Eastern nobility.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]"
msgstr "Стоит надкусить это морское создание, и рот почернеет целиком. Очень удобно, если вздумаете выдать себя за вельможу древнего Дальнего Востока.<br><br>[Можно выставить в рамке для рыбного отпечатка малого размера.]"

