msgctxt "Item:40573:0:9"
msgid "Pitch Pickle"
msgstr "Смоляной огурец"

#. ja: センベイダコ
#. de: Senbei-Oktopus
#. fr: poulpe senbei
#. column 2: senbei octopodes
#. column 8: This wavekin resembles a popular Kugane treat outside of the water, causing sailors to look twice when rummaging through supplies for a late-night snack.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Senbei Octopus
msgctxt "Item:40574:0:0"
msgid "senbei octopus"
msgstr "осьминог-сэмбэй"

#. de: Senbei-Oktopoden
#. fr: poulpes senbei
#. column 0: senbei octopus
#. column 8: This wavekin resembles a popular Kugane treat outside of the water, causing sailors to look twice when rummaging through supplies for a late-night snack.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Senbei Octopus
msgctxt "Item:40574:0:2"
msgid "senbei octopodes"
msgstr "осьминоги-сэмбэй"

#. ja: 東方の米菓に似たふわふわとした形状のタコ<br>紅玉海沖合の稀少魚<br>[魚拓額縁G1に設定可能]
#. de: Eine Kopffüßlerart, welche aufgrund ihres schwammig-weichen Körpers oft mit einem fernöstlichen Reiskräcker verglichen wird. Seltener Fisch der Rubinsee. (Kann als Fischdruck in Rahmen der Größe S ausgestellt werden.)
#. fr: Un mignon petit poulpe qui devient tout raplapla une fois pêché.<br>[Affichable dans un cadre à ichtyogramme de petite taille]
#. column 0: senbei octopus
#. column 2: senbei octopodes
#. column 9: Senbei Octopus
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:40574:0:8"
msgid "This wavekin resembles a popular Kugane treat outside of the water, causing sailors to look twice when rummaging through supplies for a late-night snack.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]"
msgstr "Вне воды это морское создание напоминает популярное лакомство из Куганэ. Моряки, роясь в припасах в поисках ночного перекуса, не раз принимали его за еду.<br><br>[Можно выставить в рамке для рыбного отпечатка малого размера.]"

#. ja: センベイダコ
#. de: Senbei-Oktopus
#. fr: Poulpe senbei
#. column 0: senbei octopus
#. column 2: senbei octopodes
#. column 8: This wavekin resembles a popular Kugane treat outside of the water, causing sailors to look twice when rummaging through supplies for a late-night snack.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
msgctxt "Item:40574:0:9"
msgid "Senbei Octopus"
msgstr "Осьминог-сэмбэй"

#. ja: タコクイ
#. de: Tintenvertilger
#. fr: requin octopophage
#. column 2: tentacle threshers
#. column 8: Displaying an almost exclusive predilection for preying on octopodes, this wavekin shows that even nature's deadliest predators can be picky eaters.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on extra large canvases.]
#. column 9: Tentacle Thresher
msgctxt "Item:40575:0:0"
msgid "tentacle thresher"
msgstr "акула-октопожор"

#. de: Tintenvertilger
#. fr: requins octopophages
#. column 0: tentacle thresher
#. column 8: Displaying an almost exclusive predilection for preying on octopodes, this wavekin shows that even nature's deadliest predators can be picky eaters.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on extra large canvases.]
#. column 9: Tentacle Thresher
msgctxt "Item:40575:0:2"
msgid "tentacle threshers"
msgstr "акулы-октопожоры"

#. ja: タコを主食とする大喰らいのサメ<br>紅玉海沖合の稀少魚<br>[魚拓額縁G4に設定可能]
#. de: Dieser gefräßige Hai macht auf nichts lieber Jagd als Tintenfische. Seltener Fisch der Rubinsee. (Kann als Fischdruck in Rahmen der Größe XL ausgestellt werden.)
#. fr: Une espèce de requin ne se nourrissant quasiment que de poulpe. Rarissime, on l'aperçoit parfois dans la Mer de Rubis.<br>[Affichable dans un cadre à ichtyogramme de très grande taille]
#. column 0: tentacle thresher
#. column 2: tentacle threshers
#. column 9: Tentacle Thresher
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:40575:0:8"
msgid "Displaying an almost exclusive predilection for preying on octopodes, this wavekin shows that even nature's deadliest predators can be picky eaters.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on extra large canvases.]"
msgstr "Эта акула почти исключительно охотится на осьминогов. Даже самые грозные хищники природы бывают привередливы в еде.<br><br>[Можно выставить в рамке для рыбного отпечатка очень большого размера.]"

#. ja: タコクイ
#. de: Tintenvertilger
#. fr: Requin octopophage
#. column 0: tentacle thresher
#. column 2: tentacle threshers
