msgstr "Жёлтый ирис"

#. ja: 紅の仁王
#. de: Rubinwächter
#. fr: gardien rubis
#. column 2: crimson sentries
#. column 8: It takes little imagination to guess how this shark, one of two guardians keeping vigil over Shisui of the Violet Tides, got its name.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
#. column 9: Crimson Sentry
msgctxt "Item:40578:0:0"
msgid "crimson sentry"
msgstr "багровый страж"

