#. fr: Lanterne orientale de pierre
#. column 0: stone toro lantern
#. column 2: stone toro lanterns
#. column 8: A moss-covered stone lantern constructed in the Far Eastern style. Its base is attached to a thick stone slab for support.
msgctxt "Item:40684:0:9"
msgid "Stone Toro Lantern"
msgstr "Каменный фонарь Торо"

#. ja: 活込石灯篭
#. de: Steinlaterne
#. fr: lanterne orientale plantée
#. column 2: planted toro lanterns
#. column 8: A moss-covered stone lantern constructed in the Far Eastern style and driven directly into the earth, the better to blend in with natural surrounds.
#. column 9: Planted Toro Lantern
msgctxt "Item:40685:0:0"
msgid "planted toro lantern"
msgstr "вкопанный фонарь Торо"

#. de: Steinlaternen
#. fr: lanternes orientales plantées
#. column 0: planted toro lantern
#. column 8: A moss-covered stone lantern constructed in the Far Eastern style and driven directly into the earth, the better to blend in with natural surrounds.
#. column 9: Planted Toro Lantern
msgctxt "Item:40685:0:2"
msgid "planted toro lanterns"
msgstr "вкопанные фонари Торо"

#. ja: 東方風の屋外用照明器具を模した、石組みの庭具。竿と呼ばれる支柱を地面に埋め込んで固定するタイプ
#. de: Eine aus Stein gefertigte Laterne für den Außenbereich, deren Rumpf für Stabilität im Boden verankert oder vergraben werden muss.
#. fr: Un ornement de jardin en pierre inspiré des lanternes d'extérieur tra<shy>di<shy>tion<shy>nel<shy>les en Hingashi. Cette version est directement plantée dans le sol.
#. column 0: planted toro lantern
#. column 2: planted toro lanterns
#. column 9: Planted Toro Lantern
msgctxt "Item:40685:0:8"
msgid "A moss-covered stone lantern constructed in the Far Eastern style and driven directly into the earth, the better to blend in with natural surrounds."
msgstr "Покрытый мхом каменный фонарь в восточном стиле, вкопанный прямо в землю, чтобы лучше вписываться в природный ландшафт."

